 content="""
I noticed that not only empty directories but any ignored nested directories are not ignored now.

```shell-session
[root@ankou etc]# grep xxx .gitignore
/xxx/
[root@ankou etc]# echo hoge > xxx/yyy/test
[root@ankou etc]# etckeeper pre-commit
[root@ankou etc]# grep xxx .etckeeper
maybe chmod 0755 'xxx'
maybe chmod 0755 'xxx/yyy'
```

My PR solves this too.
"""]]
